vielotus (1.1.1-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Official multi-architecture (amd64 & arm64) release of Sen Việt (VieLotusIM).
  * Native Fcitx5 addon (vielotus-telex, vielotus-vni) and IBus engine integration.
  * Ubuntu Language Support (language-selector-common) auto-registration for Vietnamese (vi).

